{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:451356c34489d87e","name":"Concealed Dart Launcher","source":{"id":"source:reference-451356c34489d87e","title":"Concealed Dart Launcher","revision":20118,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:15:07Z","sha256":"de0a7d9c030a0b8c59806b0bb48f4c8b192db003f48cb36a2dee2ccc7cc0a330","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20118","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Concealed%20Dart%20Launcher&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-451356c34489d87e","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Worn on the wrist and usually concealed by clothing, this weapon fires toxic darts. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deliah Blue"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deliah_Blue","referenceId":"reference:b775cd1f3cdbb4c6"}," often uses a Concealed Dart Launcher to bring down her targets quickly and without causing lethal damage. A dart can be filled with Contact ",{"tag":"a","children":["Poisons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Poisons"},", but by default it contains a potent sedative that effectively deals ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," damage to the target.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Unlike weapons set to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"},", a Concealed Dart Launcher can deal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," damage to targets farther than 6 squares away. A Concealed Dart Launcher is treated as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistol"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistol"}," for purposes of determining ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},". Because of its compact design, a Concealed Dart Launcher grants a +5 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," checks to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Conceal"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Conceal"}," the weapon. A Concealed Dart Launcher requires a bundle of darts to operate, each costing 50 credits and weighing 0.3 kilograms. After 6 shots, the bundle must be replaced.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Exotic Weapons (Ranged)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exotic_Weapons_(Ranged)","referenceId":"reference:c954289d43de9110"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Small\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 1,900\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," -\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," YES (Only, 3d8)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Rate of Fire:"]}," Single-Shot\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 0.5 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Piercing\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Illegal"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Illegal"},"\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
